Implementation:
```python
def aim(pb, target_dir, roll_ref=Vector((0,0,-1))):
    # build a rotation matrix whose Y = target_dir, Z ~ roll_ref
    y = target_dir.normalized()
    z = (roll_ref - y*roll_ref.dot(y))
    if z.length < 1e-5: z = Vector((0,0,1)) - y*y.z
    z.normalize()
    x = y.cross(z)
    m = Matrix((x, y, z)).transposed().to_4x4()
    m.translation = pb.matrix.translation  # keep position
    pb.matrix = m
```
