Careful with sign: "z deeper from viewer", so front = more negative z. Let zfront = base + dome_amp*(-b) (dome_amp>0 pushes toward the viewer). zback = zfront + thick (deeper). Actually the back should be a FLAT plane (or the same dome shifted deeper) — let me use zback = base + thick (flat). Then front-front edges connect to back edges via the rim.

